<title>USA: MDC Communications sets US$125 mln notes.</title>
<headline>MDC Communications sets US$125 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from MDC Communications Corp was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER MDC COMMUNICATIONS</p>
<p>AMT US$125 MLN     COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD		CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
